-- Generated by drizzle-kit from src/database/schema/cms.ts and
-- src/database/schema/media.ts, and hand-adjusted per DATABASE_DESIGN.md
-- §13.1 (generated SQL is reviewed; hand adjustments are written into the
-- migration file explicitly):
--   1. Every CREATE TABLE carries the design §2.1 table options
--      ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_unicode_ci.
--   2. Boolean columns are written in the design's literal form
--      tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0/1 (drizzle emitted
--      `boolean ... DEFAULT false/true`); same adjustment as 0000.
--   3. Tables are created in dependency order — media_folders,
--      media_assets, pages, page_revisions, page_sections, menus,
--      menu_items, site_settings — and `pages` is created WITHOUT its two
--      revision FKs: the pages ↔ page_revisions reference is circular
--      (§7.1 migration-order note), so fk_pages_draft_revision and
--      fk_pages_published_revision are added by ALTER TABLE at the end,
--      once page_revisions exists.
--   4. The three FKs declared in the schema as lazy column-level
--      references (the circular pair plus page_revisions.page_id) are
--      renamed from drizzle's generated names to the design names
--      fk_pages_draft_revision, fk_pages_published_revision and
--      fk_rev_page — in this file and in meta/0003_snapshot.json alike.
